UNIFORM.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.673
&gt;&gt; Dana: I WONDER ABOUT THIS

00:07:45.674 --> 00:07:47.008
BECAUSE WHEN I WAS AT THE

00:07:47.009 --> 00:07:48.876
WHITE HOUSE, I WOULD DO THIS

00:07:48.877 --> 00:07:50.044
THING CALLED A SISTER TEST.

00:07:50.045 --> 00:07:52.079
I WOULD CALL MY SISTER AND SAY

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.047
WHAT DO YOU THINK?

00:07:53.048 --> 00:07:54.615
IF SHE WOULD SAY I'VE NEVER

00:07:54.616 --> 00:07:55.016
HEARD OF IT.

00:07:55.017 --> 00:07:56.551
I WOULD SAY THANK GOD.

00:07:56.552 --> 00:08:10.965
TODAY SHE SENT ME TEXT.

00:08:10.966 --> 00:08:11.666
BOTH OF THEM, COULD THEY JUST

00:08:11.667 --> 00:08:12.133
GET IT TOGETHER.

00:08:12.134 --> 00:08:12.834
I WONDER IF THAT'S MORE -- WE

00:08:12.835 --> 00:08:13.534
CAN LAUGH FOR A MOMENT BECAUSE

00:08:13.535 --> 00:08:14.268
IT'S REALLY FUNNY BUT THERE ARE

00:08:14.269 --> 00:08:14.869
CONSEQUENCES FOR PEOPLE.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:15.503
&gt;&gt; Greg: RAND PAUL MADE A

00:08:15.504 --> 00:08:15.903
SUGGESTION.

00:08:15.904 --> 00:08:16.537
WE WANT TO PLAY THAT TAPE?

00:08:16.538 --> 00:08:17.004
DO WE HAVE TIME?

00:08:17.005 --> 00:08:17.372
NOBODY'S TALKING TO ME.

00:08:18.607 --> 00:08:20.808
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S A REAL AFFRONT

00:08:20.809 --> 00:08:22.844
TO THE AMERICAN PEOPLE.

00:08:22.845 --> 00:08:24.011
I WOULD SUGGEST

00:08:24.012 --> 00:08:24.745
SENATOR McCONNELL IS IN CHARGE

00:08:24.746 --> 00:08:25.179
OF THE SENATE.

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:26.047
LET'S HOST IT IN THE SENATE.

00:08:26.048 --> 00:08:27.882
THIS IS THE FIRST TIME IN

00:08:27.883 --> 00:08:30.051
HISTORY THE HOUSE WOULD DENY THE

00:08:30.052 --> 00:08:30.785
PRESIDENT A FORUM OF SPEAKING.

00:08:30.786 --> 00:08:33.221
IF SHE'S GOING TO DO THAT, LET'S

00:08:33.222 --> 00:08:34.455
HOLD IT IN THE SENATE.

00:08:34.456 --> 00:08:37.225
&gt;&gt; Greg: I DO NOT LIKE THIS

00:08:37.226 --> 00:08:37.525
IDEA.

00:08:37.526 --> 00:08:37.925
IT'S BORING.

00:08:37.926 --> 00:08:42.430
IT'S EVEN MORE BORING.

00:08:42.431 --> 00:08:45.199
YOU WANT TO SEE A RALLY IN

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:45.700
BILLINGS, MONTANA.

00:08:45.701 --> 00:08:47.802
&gt;&gt; Jesse: MAR-A-LAGO.

00:08:47.803 --> 00:08:49.837
&gt;&gt; Juan: HE HAD A SPEECH

00:08:49.838 --> 00:08:51.239
ALREADY IN THE OVAL OFFICE.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:54.041
DIDN'T MOVE ANYTHING?

00:08:54.042 --> 00:08:54.876
DID IT CHANGE ANYTHING?

00:08:54.877 --> 00:08:56.043
&gt;&gt; Dana: THIS IS A STATE OF

00:08:56.044 --> 00:08:56.911
THE UNION ADDRESS.

00:08:56.912 --> 00:08:58.613
IT'S A UNIFYING THING FOR THE

00:08:58.614 --> 00:08:59.013
COUNTRY.

00:08:59.014 --> 00:09:02.049
THERE'S VERY FEW TRADITIONS LEF

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:03.718
LEFT.

00:09:03.719 --> 00:09:04.819
&gt;&gt; Juan: MORE DISTORTIONS AND

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:05.820
